### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Create a product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-TOTE-300",
  "name": "Reusable Picking Tote",
  "description": "Blue tote used by warehouse pickers.",
  "unitVolume": 3,
  "reorderThreshold": 25
}

### Receive stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 50,
  "reference": "ASN-0001"
}

### Create order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 5
    }
  ]
}

### Move order through fulfillment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/start-picking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/pack
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
